VERDICT: The green log is a null result, not evidence. The gate checks only that the five names, a non-empty check string and loop fields are present, has no rule for a baseline or a three-part stop, and reads its "facts" from the same output it is judging, so the generated designs pass by construction even though the sample breaks the five-things, baseline, stop and different-kind-reviewer promises.
